1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 6=

15
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:14,840
What exactly happened?

16
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:16,460
Explain yourself.

17
00:01:17,340 --> 00:01:18,020
Grandmother,

18
00:01:18,420 --> 00:01:19,380
I don't know.

19
00:01:19,540 --> 00:01:20,980
I suddenly fainted.

20
00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:22,900
They must have brought me bad luck.

21
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:24,220
Otherwise,

22
00:01:24,940 --> 00:01:26,300
how do you explain those flames?

23
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:27,940
Weren't you unconscious?

24
00:01:27,940 --> 00:01:29,460
How would you know
about the evil flames?

25
00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:30,340
I...

26
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:32,280
You can explain yourself.

27
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,180
Bring her in.

28
00:01:37,810 --> 00:01:39,220
First Madam, save me.

29
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:48,820
Last night,
Xiang ordered her to sprinkle

30
00:01:48,820 --> 00:01:50,500
phosphorus powder on our clothes.

31
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:52,670
She also conspired
with the Taoist master

32
00:01:52,670 --> 00:01:54,440
to plant gunpowder in the courtyard

33
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:55,900
and lure us into their trap.

34
00:01:55,980 --> 00:01:57,790
Xiang used the lightning as cover

35
00:01:58,480 --> 00:01:59,520
to ignite the gunpowder.

36
00:02:04,180 --> 00:02:05,900
If you tried
to step outside the ring of fire,

37
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:07,340
the phosphorus powder on your skirts

38
00:02:07,340 --> 00:02:08,460
would fall into the flames,

39
00:02:08,820 --> 00:02:10,940
creating the illusion
of evil spirits burning you alive.

40
00:02:13,470 --> 00:02:14,260
Nonsense.

41
00:02:14,570 --> 00:02:15,380
I didn't do it.

42
00:02:15,380 --> 00:02:16,660
They're framing me.

43
00:02:16,780 --> 00:02:17,300
Shut up.

44
00:02:18,340 --> 00:02:19,980
First, you staged
this supernatural deception,

45
00:02:20,180 --> 00:02:21,340
then falsely accused
your sisters-in-law.

46
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:22,700
If I don't punish you severely,

47
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,680
won't the rules of the Marquis's Manor

48
00:02:24,790 --> 00:02:26,140
become meaningless?

49
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:27,740
From today onward,

50
00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:29,380
you'll be sent to the countryside estate

51
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:30,420
to reflect on your wrongdoings.

52
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:31,860
You need never return.

53
00:02:32,540 --> 00:02:33,180
Grandmother.

54
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:35,740
Grandmother, you can't
do this to me. Grandmother.

55
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:37,500
Wanwan.

56
00:02:38,460 --> 00:02:39,420
Wanwan, it's you...

57
00:02:39,690 --> 00:02:40,380
Bai.

58
00:02:44,780 --> 00:02:45,560
- Great-Grandmother.
- Bai.

59
00:02:45,940 --> 00:02:48,020
I know my mother has committed
a grave offense.

60
00:02:48,020 --> 00:02:49,260
I dare not ask you to show her leniency.

61
00:02:49,380 --> 00:02:50,820
My mother isn't a bad person at heart.

62
00:02:50,940 --> 00:02:52,100
She simply made a terrible mistake.

63
00:02:52,220 --> 00:02:53,220
I'm willing to leave the Marquis's Manor

64
00:02:53,220 --> 00:02:54,460
together with my mother

65
00:02:54,460 --> 00:02:55,620
to atone for her wrong doing.

66
00:02:58,940 --> 00:02:59,700
Aunt Yuyuan.

67
00:02:59,830 --> 00:03:00,580
Aunt Shutiao.

68
00:03:00,690 --> 00:03:01,940
My mother was wrong.

69
00:03:01,940 --> 00:03:03,180
She caused you both so much suffering.

70
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:04,660
I apologize on her behalf.

71
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:10,740
Bai, please get up.

72
00:03:10,850 --> 00:03:11,460
Bai.

73
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:14,780
Bai.

74
00:03:19,980 --> 00:03:20,700
Grandmother,

75
00:03:24,540 --> 00:03:26,660
I willingly accept my punishment

76
00:03:27,860 --> 00:03:30,740
and agree to sever my ties
with Bai as his mother.

77
00:03:31,820 --> 00:03:32,860
I only ask you,

78
00:03:34,020 --> 00:03:34,860
please,

79
00:03:35,340 --> 00:03:36,540
please let him stay in the manor

80
00:03:36,540 --> 00:03:37,740
and grow up well.

81
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:39,910
Mother,

82
00:03:40,180 --> 00:03:41,860
I want to go with you.

83
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:43,500
Very well.

84
00:03:44,340 --> 00:03:45,340
Bai may stay.

85
00:03:46,140 --> 00:03:47,260
As for you,

86
00:03:47,790 --> 00:03:49,380
you may return from the estate

87
00:03:49,660 --> 00:03:50,380
once you've truly

88
00:03:50,380 --> 00:03:52,340
reflected on your mistakes.

89
00:03:52,940 --> 00:03:54,620
Thank you for your mercy, Grandmother.

90
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,620
Thank you
for showing mercy, Grandmother.

91
00:03:57,220 --> 00:03:59,790
I'll reflect deeply on my mistakes.

92
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:01,720
(My dear Xiang.)

93
00:04:02,220 --> 00:04:03,620
(Since you're leaving anyway,)

94
00:04:04,220 --> 00:04:06,370
(why not do me one last favor?)

95
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:20,260
Bai.

96
00:04:20,900 --> 00:04:21,420
Come here.

97
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:22,740
Aunt Wanwan.

98
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,120
What are you doing here?

99
00:04:25,900 --> 00:04:27,400
Mother is packing her things.

100
00:04:27,550 --> 00:04:28,810
I've arranged to see her off

101
00:04:28,810 --> 00:04:30,500
with Aunt Yuyuan and Aunt Shutiao.

102
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:31,260
You're

103
00:04:31,260 --> 00:04:31,820
so well-behaved.

104
00:04:32,700 --> 00:04:34,300
Look how sweaty you are from running.

105
00:04:34,900 --> 00:04:35,860
Let me wipe your face.

106
00:04:48,640 --> 00:04:49,580
You must all be mindful

107
00:04:49,580 --> 00:04:50,780
of Bai's breathing condition.

108
00:04:51,270 --> 00:04:52,810
Keep any cats or dogs

109
00:04:52,810 --> 00:04:53,500
away from him when he's outside.

110
00:04:53,700 --> 00:04:54,700
Don't let them get near him.

111
00:04:55,420 --> 00:04:56,300
Yes, First Madam.

112
00:04:58,540 --> 00:05:00,200
Don't worry, Xiang.

113
00:05:00,580 --> 00:05:02,340
I'll take good care of Bai.

114
00:05:04,060 --> 00:05:05,340
You still have the nerve to come here?

115
00:05:05,980 --> 00:05:07,260
Look at the terrible advice you gave me.

116
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:08,300
If I hadn't listened to you,

117
00:05:08,300 --> 00:05:09,780
would I have ended up like this?

118
00:05:10,860 --> 00:05:12,340
I've been through so much,

119
00:05:12,700 --> 00:05:13,300
yet you

120
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:15,090
haven't even dared to say a word.

121
00:05:15,780 --> 00:05:16,580
Xiang,

122
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:17,860
you've got me all wrong.

123
00:05:18,670 --> 00:05:20,480
I'm just an adopted daughter
of the Marquis's family.

124
00:05:21,260 --> 00:05:22,940
Grandmother was furious at the time.

125
00:05:23,070 --> 00:05:24,580
How could I dare speak up?

126
00:05:24,750 --> 00:05:26,310
Of course I had to wait
until she calmed down

127
00:05:26,850 --> 00:05:28,460
before putting in a good word for you.

128
00:05:30,100 --> 00:05:30,580
Really?

129
00:05:31,060 --> 00:05:31,860
Xiang,

130
00:05:32,180 --> 00:05:33,380
you've treated me so well.

131
00:05:33,860 --> 00:05:34,660
You even let me manage the accounts

132
00:05:34,660 --> 00:05:35,900
and gave me a chance to gain experience.

133
00:05:36,260 --> 00:05:37,620
How could I possibly lie to you?

134
00:05:44,380 --> 00:05:45,020
Bai?

135
00:05:45,580 --> 00:05:46,590
Bai, what's wrong?

136
00:05:46,780 --> 00:05:47,300
Bai!

137
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:48,970
Bai!

138
00:05:49,450 --> 00:05:50,100
Bai!

139
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:56,180
Oh no.

140
00:05:56,540 --> 00:05:57,660
His asthma has caused a pneumothorax.

141
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,150
Someone, help!

142
00:06:02,790 --> 00:06:03,700
Someone, help!

143
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:06,300
How did this happen?

144
00:06:06,300 --> 00:06:07,300
Hurry and fetch a physician.

145
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:07,620
Yes.

146
00:06:08,180 --> 00:06:08,780
There's no time.

147
00:06:09,060 --> 00:06:10,460
I need to puncture his chest
to release the trapped air.

148
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:12,780
Oh, by the way,

149
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,540
it was terribly windy

150
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:15,540
when I came over.

151
00:06:16,420 --> 00:06:17,060
Where's Bai?

152
00:06:17,660 --> 00:06:18,540
He's frail.

153
00:06:18,860 --> 00:06:19,730
We mustn't let him catch a chill.

154
00:06:20,100 --> 00:06:21,350
I think he's in the garden.

155
00:06:21,660 --> 00:06:22,820
Oh dear, I'll bring him a coat.

156
00:06:23,660 --> 00:06:24,220
That poor child.

157
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,140
Will this work?

158
00:06:31,780 --> 00:06:32,300
Trust me.

159
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:46,180
What are you doing?

160
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,180
How dare you hurt my Bai?

161
00:06:49,660 --> 00:06:50,900
I'll make you pay!

162
00:06:54,780 --> 00:06:55,440
Yuyuan.

163
00:07:11,940 --> 00:07:12,780
Let go of me.

164
00:07:13,300 --> 00:07:14,180
Let me go!

165
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:15,940
Bai!

166
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:16,860
Bai!

167
00:07:17,570 --> 00:07:19,460
They're trying to kill my Bai!

168
00:07:19,460 --> 00:07:20,220
Be quiet!

169
00:07:20,380 --> 00:07:21,300
I'm trying to save him!

170
00:07:21,420 --> 00:07:22,220
That's a lie!

171
00:07:22,510 --> 00:07:23,300
You're clearly

172
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:24,780
holding a grudge against me

173
00:07:24,780 --> 00:07:26,180
and trying to get revenge on Bai

174
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:27,260
by killing him.

175
00:07:27,460 --> 00:07:28,980
You're still holding the weapon.

176
00:07:29,100 --> 00:07:29,700
And you expect me

177
00:07:29,700 --> 00:07:31,140
to believe you're saving him?

178
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:32,260
I believe her.

179
00:07:40,700 --> 00:07:41,460
I believe her.

180
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,620
She would never hurt Bai.

181
00:07:44,860 --> 00:07:46,540
You're all in this together.

182
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:48,660
What are you standing around for?

183
00:07:49,030 --> 00:07:50,100
Get them!

184
00:07:50,180 --> 00:07:50,850
I dare anyone to try!

185
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:52,700
♪The spring breeze sweeps
through the lanes♪

186
00:07:52,980 --> 00:07:55,270
♪Gossamer threads
hang beneath the eaves♪

187
00:07:55,270 --> 00:07:55,760
I'm here.

188
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:57,220
Just focus on treating him.

189
00:07:57,460 --> 00:07:59,940
♪The bamboo horse
treads softly through the sunset♪

190
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:02,820
♪We meet in early summer♪

191
00:08:04,260 --> 00:08:04,850
Bai.

192
00:08:04,850 --> 00:08:07,210
♪I dip my brush into the rosy sunset♪

193
00:08:07,410 --> 00:08:09,800
♪Whispering the secrets of my heart♪

194
00:08:10,250 --> 00:08:12,820
♪My eyes betray the longing in my heart♪

195
00:08:12,940 --> 00:08:13,580
Bai.

196
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:16,040
♪Yet I dare not say a word♪

197
00:08:17,350 --> 00:08:20,840
♪Watching drifting clouds cross
the green mountains♪

198
00:08:21,100 --> 00:08:23,720
♪Side by side, we hear
the evening breeze softly sigh♪

199
00:08:23,740 --> 00:08:24,740
Make way, make way.

200
00:08:24,770 --> 00:08:25,500
The physician is here.

201
00:08:26,650 --> 00:08:27,180
Hurry.

202
00:08:28,390 --> 00:08:33,030
♪I'm blessed to have you
by my side in this life♪

203
00:08:33,770 --> 00:08:37,420
♪Time and again,
I paint your face in ink♪

204
00:08:37,620 --> 00:08:39,180
What an incredible technique.

205
00:08:39,300 --> 00:08:40,460
I've only read
about this puncture procedure

206
00:08:40,610 --> 00:08:42,340
in ancient medical texts.

207
00:08:42,550 --> 00:08:44,280
If Third Madam hadn't
treated him in time,

208
00:08:44,540 --> 00:08:45,340
I'm afraid the young master

209
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:48,060
would have had little
chance of recovery.

210
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:52,240
♪May I share every dawn and dusk,
every winter and summer with you♪

211
00:08:52,250 --> 00:08:56,190
♪Through the years,
from dark hair to gray♪

212
00:08:56,660 --> 00:08:57,540
Let me carry you back.

213
00:08:58,940 --> 00:08:59,580
No need.

214
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:00,700
My legs are just numb
from crouching too long.

215
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:01,540
Then I'll help you back.

216
00:09:02,260 --> 00:09:02,660
Come on.

217
00:09:03,610 --> 00:09:07,490
♪Through beautiful seasons,
we'll share our years♪

218
00:09:07,490 --> 00:09:12,630
♪May I never fail the love
we share in this life♪

219
00:09:14,300 --> 00:09:14,980
Let go of me.

220
00:09:15,860 --> 00:09:16,380
Bai.

221
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:17,080
Bai.

222
00:09:17,460 --> 00:09:18,020
Shutiao.

223
00:09:24,260 --> 00:09:25,060
I came

224
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:26,380
to bring you some duck soup.

225
00:09:26,860 --> 00:09:27,780
Don't get the wrong idea.

226
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:30,180
You saved Bai, after all.

227
00:09:31,220 --> 00:09:33,140
If Grandmother accuses me
of neglecting you,

228
00:09:33,460 --> 00:09:34,300
I won't be able to answer to her.

229
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:37,180
You little brat.

230
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:41,340
You're still holding the weapon.

231
00:09:41,500 --> 00:09:43,580
And you expect me
to believe you're saving him?

232
00:09:43,900 --> 00:09:44,580
I believe her.

233
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:49,630
♪On whose fingertips
does the wind come to rest?♪

234
00:09:50,420 --> 00:09:51,870
(He usually seems so unreliable.)

235
00:09:52,660 --> 00:09:53,660
(But when it really matters,)

236
00:09:54,170 --> 00:09:55,220
(he's surprisingly dependable.)

237
00:09:58,700 --> 00:10:03,880
♪I hear the abyss just a breath away♪

238
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:06,280
♪It's your breathing♪

239
00:10:06,690 --> 00:10:09,050
♪That throws me off balance♪

240
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,150
♪And slowly spreads♪

241
00:10:14,970 --> 00:10:18,380
♪Light hides within your eyes♪

242
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:23,500
♪My reason is slowly♪

243
00:10:24,140 --> 00:10:25,860
♪Giving way♪

244
00:10:27,700 --> 00:10:28,820
(An ordinary person's pulse)

245
00:10:29,340 --> 00:10:30,700
(beats only four or five times
in a moment.)

246
00:10:31,700 --> 00:10:32,940
(Why does my heart)

247
00:10:33,980 --> 00:10:35,460
(race whenever I think of her?)

248
00:10:37,220 --> 00:10:38,540
(Calm down.)

249
00:10:38,660 --> 00:10:39,300
Shen He.

250
00:10:39,300 --> 00:10:39,620
Huh?

251
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:40,620
Come in.

252
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:41,860
I have something for you.

253
00:10:47,420 --> 00:10:47,940
Wait...

254
00:10:48,900 --> 00:10:49,580
What are you doing?

255
00:10:49,580 --> 00:10:50,180
This is so sudden.

256
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:52,260
I'm a traditional man.

257
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:54,340
Some things

258
00:10:54,340 --> 00:10:56,020
require a little preparation.

259
00:10:56,580 --> 00:10:57,210
I...

260
00:10:57,300 --> 00:10:57,700
I'm...

261
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,340
Cut the nonsense.

262
00:10:59,520 --> 00:10:59,980
Open your eyes.

263
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:19,260
I read your coroner's manual.

264
00:11:19,380 --> 00:11:20,660
Many of the examination techniques

265
00:11:20,660 --> 00:11:22,020
for male and female bodies
are incorrect.

266
00:11:22,340 --> 00:11:23,100
So

267
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:24,500
I made one of these for you too.

268
00:11:27,380 --> 00:11:28,060
This way,

269
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:28,900
the next time

270
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:29,950
you come to me with questions,

271
00:11:29,950 --> 00:11:30,660
I can teach you properly.

272
00:11:37,090 --> 00:11:38,660
So this is what you wanted to give me?

273
00:11:39,710 --> 00:11:40,460
What else?

274
00:11:42,780 --> 00:11:43,500
Nothing.

275
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:47,900
Do you like it?

276
00:11:48,250 --> 00:11:48,940
I do.

277
00:11:51,580 --> 00:11:52,130
Your Lordship,

278
00:11:52,900 --> 00:11:53,820
near Qinghe Manor,

279
00:11:53,820 --> 00:11:54,980
we've found a lead
on a dancing girl's whereabouts.

280
00:12:02,220 --> 00:12:04,540
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

281
00:12:04,540 --> 00:12:11,740
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

282
00:12:11,740 --> 00:12:16,940
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

283
